{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30356","headline":"下第寄宣城幕中诸公 · 赵嘏","name":"下第寄宣城幕中诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一醉曾将万事齐，暂陪欢去便如泥。\n黄花李白墓前路，碧浪桓彝宅後溪。\n九月霜中随计吏，十年江上灌春畦。\n莫言春尽不惆怅，自有闲眠到日西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}